{"id":"96a7916ef9ebba8a","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-zpp.md","title":"df-zpp (ZPP Complexity Class)","display":"df-zpp (ZPP Complexity Class)","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","display":"df-zpp (ZPP Complexity Class)","label":"28-df-zpp","type":"definition","aliases":["28-df-zpp","ZPP","ZPP Complexity Class"],"depends_on":["[[28-df-ppt]]"],"source_book_location":"Definition 7.7; printed p.131; PDF p.157","source_printed_pages":"131","source_pdf_pages":"157","source_status":"statement-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zpp (ZPP Complexity Class)"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-zpp"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-zpp</span><span>ZPP</span><span>ZPP Complexity Class</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b75200f005282ddf\" href=\"?note=b75200f005282ddf\" title=\"28-df-ppt\">28-df-ppt</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Definition 7.7; printed p.131; PDF p.157"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"131"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"157"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\">\\(L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_L:\\Sigma^*\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\chi_L:\\Sigma^*\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 由下式定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\\in\\mathsf{RTM}\">\\(N\\in\\mathsf{RTM}\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b75200f005282ddf\" href=\"?note=b75200f005282ddf\" title=\"28-df-ppt\">28-df-ppt</a> 定义的双转移表在线随机机；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\leftarrow\\nu\">\\(r\\leftarrow\\nu\\)</span> 为独立公平比特带，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_N(x,r)\">\\(T_N(x,r)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O_N(x,r)\">\\(O_N(x,r)\\)</span> 为其中定义的停机时间和输出。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{ZPP}\">\\(\\mathbf{ZPP}\\)</span> 为零错误期望多项式时间语言类。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\chi_L:\\Sigma^*\\to\\{0,1\\},\\qquad\\chi_L(x)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1&amp;x\\in L,\\\\0&amp;x\\notin L.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\chi_L:\\Sigma^*\\to\\{0,1\\},\\qquad\\chi_L(x)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1&amp;x\\in L,\\\\0&amp;x\\notin L.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{ZPP}\\coloneqq\\left\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\ \\middle|\\ \\exists N\\in\\mathsf{RTM}\\;\\exists a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left[\\mathbb E_{r\\leftarrow\\nu}T_N(x,r)\\le c(|x|+1)^a\\land\\forall r\\in\\Sigma^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\bigl(T_N(x,r)&lt;\\infty\\Rightarrow O_N(x,r)=\\chi_L(x)\\bigr)\\right]\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{ZPP}\\coloneqq\\left\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\ \\middle|\\ \\exists N\\in\\mathsf{RTM}\\;\\exists a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left[\\mathbb E_{r\\leftarrow\\nu}T_N(x,r)\\le c(|x|+1)^a\\land\\forall r\\in\\Sigma^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\bigl(T_N(x,r)&lt;\\infty\\Rightarrow O_N(x,r)=\\chi_L(x)\\bigr)\\right]\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有限期望蕴涵以概率 1 停机；即便在零测集随机带上停机，输出也须正确。定义独立于 RP 与 coRP，故 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b4f292ee2a50229e\" href=\"?note=b4f292ee2a50229e\" title=\"28-thm-zpp-rp-intersection-corp\">28-thm-zpp-rp-intersection-corp</a> 是需要证明的等价定理。</p>\n<p>R7：内建特征函数的值域和非成员的0分支。原来仅给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_L(x)=1\\leftrightarrow x\\in L\">\\(\\chi_L(x)=1\\leftrightarrow x\\in L\\)</span> 不能在未声明二元值域时唯一确定非成员输出；现在零错误要求对每个输入有唯一的目标比特。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-ppt","status":"resolved","id":"b75200f005282ddf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-ppt]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-ppt","status":"resolved","id":"b75200f005282ddf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$N\\in\\mathsf{RTM}$ 为 [[28-df-ppt]] 定义的双转移表在线随机机；$r\\leftarrow\\nu$ 为独立公平比特带，$T_N(x,r)$、$O_N(x,r)$ 为其中定义的停机时间和输出。","embed":false},{"target":"28-thm-zpp-rp-intersection-corp","status":"resolved","id":"b4f292ee2a50229e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"有限期望蕴涵以概率 1 停机；即便在零测集随机带上停机，输出也须正确。定义独立于 RP 与 coRP，故 [[28-thm-zpp-rp-intersection-corp]] 是需要证明的等价定理。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_L:\\Sigma^*\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"N\\in\\mathsf{RTM}","display":false},{"tex":"r\\leftarrow\\nu","display":false},{"tex":"T_N(x,r)","display":false},{"tex":"O_N(x,r)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{ZPP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_L:\\Sigma^*\\to\\{0,1\\},\\qquad\\chi_L(x)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1&x\\in L,\\\\0&x\\notin L.\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf{ZPP}\\coloneqq\\left\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\ \\middle|\\ \\exists N\\in\\mathsf{RTM}\\;\\exists a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left[\\mathbb E_{r\\leftarrow\\nu}T_N(x,r)\\le c(|x|+1)^a\\land\\forall r\\in\\Sigma^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\bigl(T_N(x,r)<\\infty\\Rightarrow O_N(x,r)=\\chi_L(x)\\bigr)\\right]\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\chi_L(x)=1\\leftrightarrow x\\in L","display":false}],"bytes":1664,"backlinks":[{"id":"b1af4753e8e3740a","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"本书定义 7.1 以两个转移函数和独立公平硬币定义概率机；本节点采用定义 7.3 的有限随机带表示，限于总停机判定计算。无界期望时间的零错误计算另见 [[28-df-zpp]]。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-115","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"概率机器与类：[[28-df-probabilistic-tm]]、[[28-df-bpp]]、[[28-df-rp]]、[[28-df-co-rp]]、[[28-df-zpp]]、[[28-df-pp]]。"},{"id":"b4f292ee2a50229e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf{ZPP}$ 为 [[28-df-zpp]] 的零错误期望时间类，$\\mathbf{RP}$、$\\mathbf{coRP}$ 分别见 [[28-df-rp]]、[[28-df-co-rp]]。"}],"outgoing":["b75200f005282ddf","b4f292ee2a50229e"]}